एकया यात्यनावृत्तिमन्ययावर्तते पुन: ॥ २६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2521,\"bb\":2231,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/8/26/b2231/\",\"body_value\":\"śukla-kṛṣṇe gatī hy ete
jagataḥ śāśvate mate
ekayā yāty anāvṛttim
anyayāvartate punaḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":2522,\"bb\":2232,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/8/26/b2232/\",\"shadow_value\":\"śukla – light; kṛṣṇe – and darkness; gatī – ways of passing; hi – certainly; ete – these two; jagataḥ – of the material world; śāśvate – of the Vedas; mate – in the opinion; ekayā – by one; yāti – goes; anāvṛttim – to no return; anyayā – by the other; āvartate – comes back; punaḥ – again.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"śukla\",\"translation\":\"light\"},{\"word\":\"kṛṣṇe\",\"translation\":\"and darkness\"},{\"word\":\"gatī\",\"translation\":\"ways of passing\"},{\"word\":\"hi\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"ete\",\"translation\":\"these two\"},{\"word\":\"jagataḥ\",\"translation\":\"of the material world\"},{\"word\":\"śāśvate\",\"translation\":\"of the Vedas\"},{\"word\":\"mate\",\"translation\":\"in the opinion\"},{\"word\":\"ekayā\",\"translation\":\"by one\"},{\"word\":\"yāti\",\"translation\":\"goes\"},{\"word\":\"anāvṛttim\",\"translation\":\"to no return\"},{\"word\":\"anyayā\",\"translation\":\"by the other\"},{\"word\":\"āvartate\",\"translation\":\"comes back\"},{\"word\":\"punaḥ\",\"translation\":\"again\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":2523,\"bb\":2233,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/8/26/b2233/\",\"body_value\":\"According to Vedic opinion, there are two ways of passing from this world – one in light and one in darkness. When one passes in light, he does not come back; but when one passes in darkness, he returns.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2524,\"bb\":2234,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/8/26/b2234/\",\"body_value\":\"The same description of departure and